    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo></mstyle><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is:",
